            <ArticleTitle>Effect of testosterone therapy on QT dispersion in men with heart failure.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1241-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The effects of testosterone on cardiac electrophysiology are poorly described. In this study we report the effect of physiologic testosterone therapy in 2 cohorts of men, the first with stable coronary disease and the second with congestive heart failure. Testosterone reduced QT dispersion in the heart failure cohort; no other effects were observed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
